/-- [DIRX], §3.3: $G_{LJQ}(0,1)=0$ and $G_{LJQ}(\frac14,\frac34)>0.01$. -/
theorem G_LJQ_diag_eval : G_LJQX 0 1 = 0 ∧ G_LJQX 4⁻¹ (3 / 4) > 0.01 := by
